"""Register the estate's mirrored methods as engine definitions (2026-09-04).

Wirecut, de-llm and the Referee keep their doctrines in their own repos today;
the registry mirrors each named method as an EngineDefinition with
family / home_organ / runs_at / lineage_refs / sync="mirrored", so The Master
can show and, later, serve them. The Analyst's own process engines and the
designed imagination/governance engines are registered too.

Idempotent: re-running rewrites the same files. Existing analytical engine
definitions are never touched.
"""
